
/////////////////////
// BattleSense.tp2 //
/////////////////////

// Component names
@10 = ~Attack Info: Show to-hit chances, damage and timers when hovering an enemy or a fighting ally (replaces EEex's attack info module)~
@20 = ~Timer: Show casting, attack round, modal and contingency bars, and resistance rings, beside portraits (replaces EEex's timer module)~
@30 = ~Combat Log: Explain effects ending, failed saves, immunities and ineffective weapons (adds a hidden effect to creatures, which is stored in save games)~
@40 = ~Item Info: Show the properties of an item, and how equipping it would change the selected character's stats, when hovering it in a store, a container, the quick loot bar or the inventory~
@50 = ~Spell Info: Show what a spell, wand or scroll will do to a creature, (magic resistance, saving throws, damage, immunities), when hovering it while the spell waits for a target~
@60 = ~Ability Info: Show what an ability score gives, (to-hit, armor class, hit points, spells, ...), when hovering it on the abilities screen of character creation~
@70 = ~Proficiency Info: Show what the points of a weapon proficiency or fighting style give, (to-hit, damage, speed, attacks per round, style bonuses), when hovering it on the proficiencies screen at character creation and level up~
@80 = ~Container Colors: Outline locked containers red and empty containers gray (replaces EEex's empty container module)~
@90 = ~Lock Info: Show how hard a lock or found trap is, and each selected character's chance to pick, force or disarm it, when hovering a container, door or trap~

// Error messages
@1000 = ~Game not supported. Battle Sense requires BG:EE, BG2:EE, EET or IWD:EE.~
@1001 = ~Battle Sense requires EEex to be installed first.~
